The 1,720-byte read-only pogo bridge generated by evenRealities-webflasher
(src/lib/pogoBridge.js, POGO_BRIDGE_BASE64, commit 2fcdb88), byte-identical to
drdaeman/g2-bootloader-patch tools/g2patch/data/case_bridge.bin (commit 1d22097).
SHA-256 e30e143d522e5a5d0b10a92a15610badcc6aef014333716a94eae183b14dc258.
It contains no Even Realities code; it calls functions of the case's own
1.2.57 firmware by address. Full notice: ../../NOTICE.md.
